OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ARussell Brand prison message
OL,4,A'appalling' and being investigated, No
OL,5,A10 says
OL,6,
OL,7,FNo 10 said it expects action to be
OL,8,Ftaken if Brand is found to have broken
OL,9,Fprison rules, while Victims'
OL,10,FCommissioner for London Andrea Simon
OL,11,Fsaid the claims will "certainly
OL,12,Fretraumatise his victims and other
OL,13,Fsurvivors of rape who have to hear it".
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQpppppppppppppppppppppG13/19
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
